    "SQLite might not have the JSON1 extension enabled in this environment, causing `json_each` to fail. If so, the code should fallback to the original behavior or raise an error. However, JSON1 is standard in most modern SQLite distributions.",
    "The `json_each` approach requires careful handling of the `tags` column to ensure it matches the expected JSON array format. If the data is malformed, it might cause errors.",
    "The `total` count query also needs to use the same filtering logic to ensure consistency between `items` and `total`."
  ],
